  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Die Vielfalt seiner Einrichtungen zieht Familien und Anhänger von Freiluftsportarten an: Schwimmen, Wassersportverleih, Spiel- und Picknickplätze, Gesundheitsparcours/Fitnessbereich, Beachvolleyball und Tennis, Angeln, Minigolf, Snackbar."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The diversity of its facilities attracts families and fans of outdoor sports: swimming area and water material rentals, playgrounds and picnic areas, health trail/fitness area, beach volleyball and tennis, fishing, mini golf, snack bar."
    ],
    "it": [
      "La varietà delle sue strutture attira sia le famiglie che gli appassionati di sport all'aria aperta: nuoto, noleggio di sport acquatici, parchi giochi e aree picnic, percorso fitness/area fitness, beach volley e tennis, pesca, mini golf, snack bar."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "La diversité de ses aménagements attire familles et adeptes de sports en plein air : baignade, locations nautiques, aires de jeux et pique-nique, parcours de santé/espace fitness,  beach-volley et tennis, pêche, mini golf, bar snack."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Strand is geopend en er is toezicht van Juni tot Augustus.\r\nSpeel area, hindernisbaan, speelveld, snacks en frisdranken.\r\nToegangskosten in de zomer"
    ],
    "es": [
      "La diversidad de sus instalaciones atrae por igual a familias y amantes de los deportes al aire libre: natación, alquiler de deportes acuáticos, zonas de juegos y picnic, pista de fitness/zona de fitness, voley playa y tenis, pesca, minigolf, snack bar."
    ]
  },
